        "message": "Allow the non-GPU placement guard for any pinned Phase 5 trial\n\n--require-non-gpu-node previously required --moving-timing-trace, which\ncontradicts the fixed recovery-series runner committed earlier: the\nseries propagates --node-name and --require-non-gpu-node to all ten\ntrials, none of which is a timing trace. The guard now requires a pinned\nnode for any trial and still refuses to combine with --allow-g5-node;\nthe fail-closed Ready/GPU-free node check before resource creation is\nunchanged. This widens enforcement to more trials; no guard is weakened."
      },
